  "dcterms:title": "PHW Consent",
  "dcterms:description": "A privacy consent directive held for, and shown to, the holder of a Personal Health Wallet: an IHE PCF 1.1.0 Intermediate Consent whose policy is set by a trust domain. Either explicit (PHWExplicitConsent) or implied (PHWImpliedConsent). Trust-anchor neutral: GDHCN is one possible trust anchor among others.",
